{
  "formato": "sauim",
  "versao": 1,
  "conteudo_html": "<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd\">\n<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><meta charset=\"utf-8\" /><style type=\"text/css\">\np, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\nhr { height: 1px; border-width: 0; }\nli.unchecked::marker { content: \"\\2610\"; }\nli.checked::marker { content: \"\\2612\"; }\n</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Arial'; font-size:11pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:4px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" width=\"124\" height=\"124\" /></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\" margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:2px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-size:26pt; font-weight:700; color:#5a3a22;\">Bem-vindo ao Sauim </span></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:24px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-size:13pt; font-style:italic; color:#7a7a7a;\">Um editor de texto simples, feito para você ter controle sobre seus documentos.</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:20px; margin-bottom:10px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-size:16pt; font-weight:700; color:#8a5a2b;\">Formatação de texto</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" color:#1a1a1a;\">O Sauim já permite deixar o texto em </span><span style=\" font-weight:700; color:#1a1a1a;\">negrito</span><span style=\" color:#1a1a1a;\">, </span><span style=\" font-style:italic; color:#1a1a1a;\">itálico</span><span style=\" color:#1a1a1a;\">, </span><span style=\" text-decoration: underline; color:#1a1a1a;\">sublinhado</span><span style=\" color:#1a1a1a;\"> ou </span><span style=\" text-decoration: line-through; color:#1a1a1a;\">tachado</span><span style=\" color:#1a1a1a;\"> — e também combinar tudo isso, como neste trecho em </span><span style=\" font-weight:700; font-style:italic; color:#1a1a1a;\">negrito e itálico ao mesmo tempo</span><span style=\" color:#1a1a1a;\">.</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" color:#1a1a1a;\">Os recursos básicos como escolher a </span><span style=\" font-weight:700; color:#c0392b;\">cor da fonte</span><span style=\" color:#1a1a1a;\">, uso de </span><span style=\" color:#1a1a1a; background-color:#fff176;\">marca-texto</span><span style=\" color:#1a1a1a;\"> para destacar passagens importantes, ou </span><span style=\" color:#1565c0; background-color:#e3f2fd;\">combinações de</span><span style=\" font-weight:700; color:#1565c0; background-color:#e3f2fd;\"> formatação </span><span style=\" color:#1a1a1a;\">ao mesmo tempo.</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" color:#1a1a1a;\">A fonte e o tamanho também são ajustáveis — </span><span style=\" font-family:'Georgia'; font-size:12pt; color:#1a1a1a;\">Georgia</span><span style=\" font-size:12pt; color:#1a1a1a;\">, </span><span style=\" font-family:'Broadway'; font-size:12pt; color:#1a1a1a;\">Broadway</span><span style=\" font-size:12pt; color:#1a1a1a;\">, </span><span style=\" font-family:'Old English Text MT'; font-size:12pt; color:#1a1a1a;\">Old Style</span><span style=\" font-size:12pt; color:#1a1a1a;\">, </span><span style=\" font-family:'Bauhaus 93'; font-size:12pt; color:#1a1a1a;\">Bauhaus</span><span style=\" color:#1a1a1a;\">, ou </span><span style=\" font-size:16pt; color:#1a1a1a;\">Arial tamanho 16</span><span style=\" color:#1a1a1a;\">.</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:24px; margin-bottom:10px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-size:16pt; font-weight:700; color:#8a5a2b;\">Alinhamento de parágrafo</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" color:#1a1a1a;\">Este parágrafo está alinhado à esquerda — o padrão ao começar um documento novo.</span></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" color:#1a1a1a;\">Este parágrafo está centralizado, útil para títulos e destaques.</span></p>\n<p align=\"right\" style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" color:#1a1a1a;\">Este parágrafo está alinhado à direita.</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" color:#1a1a1a;\">Este parágrafo está justificado, o que significa que o texto se estica para ocupar toda a largura da linha de forma uniforme, alinhando tanto a margem esquerda quanto a direita — um recurso comum em livros, jornais e documentos formais, e que o Sauim já suporta desde as primeiras versões. </span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:24px; margin-bottom:10px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-size:16pt; font-weight:700; color:#8a5a2b;\">Listas</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:4px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-weight:700; color:#1a1a1a;\">Marcadores:</span></p>\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; -qt-list-indent: 1;\">\n<li style=\" color:#1a1a1a;\" style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Marcadores disponíveis na barra de ferramentas</li>\n<li style=\" color:#1a1a1a;\" style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Indentado com Tab para criar sub-itens\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; -qt-list-indent: 2;\">\n<li style=\" color:#1a1a1a;\" style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Como este aqui\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; -qt-list-indent: 3;\">\n<li style=\" color:#1a1a1a;\" style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">E este também</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul>\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; -qt-list-indent: 2;\">\n<li style=\" color:#1a1a1a;\" style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">E aqui</li></ul>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:4px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-weight:700; color:#1a1a1a;\">Numeração (com níveis):</span></p>\n<ol style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; -qt-list-indent: 1; -qt-list-number-prefix: '';\">\n<li style=\" color:#1a1a1a;\" style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Numeração automática\n<ol style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; -qt-list-indent: 2; -qt-list-number-prefix: '1.'; -qt-list-number-suffix: '';\">\n<li style=\" color:#1a1a1a;\" style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Para item e subitem</li>\n<li style=\" color:#1a1a1a;\" style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Como este\n<ol style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; -qt-list-indent: 3; -qt-list-number-prefix: '1.2.'; -qt-list-number-suffix: '';\">\n<li style=\" color:#1a1a1a;\" style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Ou um nível a mais</li>\n<li style=\" color:#1a1a1a;\" style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Como estes</li></ol></li></ol></li>\n<li style=\" color:#1a1a1a;\" style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Segundo item do nível principal</li>\n<li style=\" color:#1a1a1a;\" style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Terceiro item do nível principal </li></ol>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\" margin-top:28px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-style:italic; color:#7a7a7a;\">Este documento foi criado inteiramente com recursos já disponíveis no Sauim.<br />Experimente abrir, editar e salvar!</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:28px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-size:16pt; font-weight:700; color:#8a5a2b;\">Nome</span></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:28px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-weight:700;\">Sagui </span>é uma família de macacos que ocorre na América do Sul. <span style=\" font-weight:700; color:#000000;\">Sauim</span><span style=\" font-weight:700; color:#aa0000;\"> </span>é a palavra em Tupi Guarani para Sagui, segundo o biblioteca da Funai.</p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:28px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">(<span style=\" font-size:9pt; font-style:italic;\">https://biblioteca.funai.gov.br/media/pdf/Folheto43/FO-CX-43-2739-2000.pdf</span>)</p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:28px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">(<span style=\" font-size:9pt; font-style:italic;\">https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Calitriqu%C3%ADdeos</span>)</p></body></html>",
  "pagina": {
    "largura_mm": 210,
    "altura_mm": 297,
    "margem_mm": 25
  }
}